          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>UX FRICTION POINT</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='6633' hidden='true' id='51' story-point-id='6' type-v2='text' w='51384' x='27524' y='69898'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000'>🏆 The redesign improved performance across all customer segments.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='38520' hidden='true' id='52' story-point-id='23' type-v2='text' w='30682' x='2273' y='40051'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>1. Roll out the redesigned experience</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> to all users.The new onboarding flow </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>improves completion rates and overall navigation performance.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='5102' hidden='true' id='53' story-point-id='23' type-v2='text' w='32980' x='6433' y='18878'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>RECOMMENDATIONS &amp; NEXTS STEPS</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='38265' hidden='true' id='54' story-point-id='23' type-v2='text' w='31412' x='34903' y='40306'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>2. Prioritize redesign of Step 1  </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'>Despite overall success, Step 1 shows critical friction points: longer navigation times, increased drop-offs, and an </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Error Rate of 33.5%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> (causing 1 in 3 users to go backward). </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='38138' hidden='true' id='55' story-point-id='23' type-v2='text' w='29140' x='68425' y='40306'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>3. Continue monitoring post-launch behavior.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Track KPIs and user interactions to identify future optimization opportunities.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
